{"about_the_game":"<strong>Welcome to the world of Mage Mania!</strong><br><br>Become the ultimate mage in this fun but deadly game. Combine the elements to make crazy magic to eliminate other mages that stand in your path to victory! <br><br>Mage Mania is a party game where your main goal is to eliminate the competition on becoming the last mage standing! Use fire, air, water and earth to create magics that will blow your opponents away! Play locally with your friends and start this quest to become the best mage on the couch. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101170/extras/6f3d02f042cc9c69810077122716873c.avif?t=1576248882\" width=616 height=352 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Local Multiplayer.<br></li><li> 2 keyboard players.<br></li><li> Controller <strong><u>REQUIRED</u></strong> to play with more than 2 players. <br></li><li> 4 elements, 10 spells.<br></li><li> Beautiful levels with different obstacles.<br></li><li> Fun sound-effects.</li></ul><br>Disclaimer: Mage Mania is a multiplayer game. Playing it alone is only allowed when on the tutorial.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101170/extras/936d79eb03366f9eba6d84a7795790a2.avif?t=1576248882\" width=616 height=352 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"7c605fd9076769d88a87b888b344fb617997fc00.jpg","localized_name":"Welcome to Mage Mania","name":"Welcome to Mage Mania","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1101170/7c605fd9076769d88a87b888b344fb617997fc00.jpg"},{"icon":"6a29351c370239734ba5208186f58bef4e3165e8.jpg","localized_name":"Pyromaniac","name":"Pyromaniac","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1101170/6a29351c370239734ba5208186f58bef4e3165e8.jpg"},{"icon":"3424b08ddda2245ebb27d308be6d40c57a326ce7.jpg","localized_na